guide polestar-completionist-alliance/dungeon-scholomance
title Scholomance (Completionist)
faction Alliance
category Dungeons
levels 58-60
zone Western Plaguelands
next polestar-completionist-alliance/56-swamp-of-sorrows-2
pitch Scholomance, in Western Plaguelands.
why Every Alliance quest of Scholomance: the chains that lead to it, the pick-ups before the run and the hand-ins after it.

